{"id":"n60194-1-10","stage":5,"title":"복합 · 复合","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60194-1-10-1","ko":"이 휴대폰으로는 음악을 들으면서 문자 메시지를 보낼 수 있어.","zh":"用这部手机可以边听音乐边发短信哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"휴대폰으로는","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴대폰으로는","audio":"/audio/0a2731041f9e3888e5a7.mp3"}},{"text":"음악을","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악을","audio":"/audio/e98d4fc72578a9d7791a.mp3"}},{"text":"들으면서","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"1","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으면서","audio":"/audio/4a02dc66e51dca4738c9.mp3"}},{"text":"문자","meaning":"文字","explanation":"문자：文字","readings":[{"term":"문자","audio":"/audio/4ea374f4ded3131b7083.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15715","senseId":"1","lemma":"문자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문자","audio":"/audio/4ea374f4ded3131b7083.mp3"}},{"text":"메시지를","meaning":"信息，通告，寄语","explanation":"메시지：信息，通告，寄语；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"메시지","audio":"/audio/4cd44bae95c4239c79a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55534",