4239c","term":"메시지","zh":"信息，通告，寄语","audio":"/audio/4cd44bae95c4239c79a2.mp3","entryId":"55534","definition":"为了通知、主张或警告某件事情而特地传达的消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"发送","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"使内容被传达。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/de754174acb67c10973e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60194-1-10-2","ko":"여러 가지 복합 기능이 있는 휴대폰이구나.","zh":"这手机真是有好多不同的多功能呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"种，项，类别，个","explanation":"가지：种，项，类别，个","readings":[{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59921","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}},{"text":"복합","meaning":"复合","explanation":"복합：复合","readings":[{"term":"복합","audio":"/audio/779bcc6f4543d1380d4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60194","senseId":"1","lemma":"복합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복합","audio":"/audio/779bcc6f4543d1380d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"기능이","meaning":"功能，机能","explanation":"기능：功能，机能；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기능","audio":"/audio/0e09e85c99c11646eebb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32491","senseId":"1","lemma":"기능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{